- Do not change the existing `given` or `when` steps, and do not touch any other scenario, the `metadata:` block, or the header comments.
- Do not edit `docs/product/product.yaml`, `tests/greeter/greet_test.go`, or any step definition.
- After the edit, `scenarios.E2E-001.merged_steps` must carry all three kinds, and the registry must still validate against `true-bdd/scenarios_yaml-schema.yaml`.

